    bounds: [62, 478, 836, 20]
    content:
      fontSize: 8.5
      color: "$ink"
      text: "<b>Physics Takeaway:</b> Achieving Q_plasma &gt; 1 is an essential laboratory proof of concept; commercial power stations require Q_plasma ≥ 25 to achieve net grid feed."

